      "content": "thanks for this. it's a good start. can u expand on the 1957 period? specifically, i want to show how the colonial government's response was basically just a desperate attempt to crush a legitimate movement that had already won the moral high ground. can u highlight the ways their crackdown just proved they were losing control of the situation?",
